    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-15" id="fn-15" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">General Plant reported does not include an allocation of corporate facilities to or from Tallgrass Energy Partners, LP ("TEP") and affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-16" id="fn-16" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">In accordance with the Tax Cuts and Jobs Act signed into law on December 22, 2017, TIGT remeasured its accumulated deferred income taxes (Accounts 190, 282, and 283) during the year ended December 31, 2017 based on the new tax rates, resulting in a decrease in the net deferred tax asset. This adjustment was recorded in Account 182.3. The balance is amortized to Account 410.1, Provision of Deferred Income Taxes, over the estimated remaining useful life of the pipeline.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-17" id="fn-17" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents under collections pursuant to the TIGT tariff fuel/power tracking mechanisms.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-18" id="fn-18" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents under collections pursuant to the TIGT tariff fuel/power tracking mechanisms.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-19" id="fn-19" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents the Annual Charge Adjustment ("ACA"), which is an annual fee charged by the FERC and recovered from the shippers.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-20" id="fn-20" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents deferred rate case costs, which are amortized over a period of three years.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-21" id="fn-21" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents revenues from penalties associated with operational flow orders that will be refunded to shippers pursuant to Section 34 of the General Terms and Conditions of the Tariff.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-22" id="fn-22" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents the portion of a public utility&#8217;s accumulated deferred income tax (ADIT) balances that are no longer owed to the IRS due to changes in the corporate tax rate.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-23" id="fn-23" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents collections pursuant to the TIGT tariff fuel/power tracking mechanisms.</link:footnote>
